<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τροφώνιος</span></b> , ὁ, the
		legendary builder of the first temple of Apollo at Delphi, <i><span class="en">
			<u>h.Ap.</u>
			296
		</span></i>; afterwards himself the possessor of a celebrated oracle, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			2
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.46
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			8.134
		</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβαίνων ὥσπερ ἐς
		Τροφωνίου</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντρον</span>)
			<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Nu.</u>
			508
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					9.2.38
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τροφώνεια</span></b> , τά, <i>his festival,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				7.49.10
			</span></i> (Megara, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				22.3169.18
			</span></i> (Athens, <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>); written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τροφώνια</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.3147
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.37
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ωνίαι</span>
			): both prob. 
				contr.
			 fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τροφωνίεια.</span> (An older form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρεφώνιος</span></b>  in 
				Boeot.
			 Inscrr., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.3055
			</span></i> (Lebad.), <i><span class="en">
				3080
			</span></i> (ibid.), <i><span class="en">
				4136
			</span></i> (Ptoön, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), al.)</div>
